{"id":"steam-1042350","steam":1042350,"igdb":null,"type":"game","title":"Ironlaw","summary":"Ironlaw is a colony management game set in a procedurally generated world. Form alliances with other civilizations, fight battles with your enemies and build colonies.","about":"Ironlaw is a game that combines the colony management aspects of games like Dwarf Fortress and Gnomoria with the party-based war, diplomacy and quests mechanics of Mount & Blade.\r\n\r\n\nFeatures\n\r\n\n\r\n• Take control of a person in a procedurally generated world\r\n• Recruit people to join your party of fighters\r\n• Build colonies in multiple biomes anywhere on the map\r\n• Visit procedurally generated cities\r\n• Extremely moddable\r\n\n\r\n\r\n\nWork in progress features\n\r\n\n\r\n• Complete procedurally generated quests given by inhabitants of the world\r\n• Fight battles with enemy troops\r\n• Conquer enemy cities\r\n• Design your own custom maps and cities","cover":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1042350/library_600x900.jpg?t=1663543376","coverFallback":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1042350/header.jpg?t=1663543376","banner":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1042350/library_hero.jpg?t=1663543376","header":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1042350/header.jpg?t=1663543376","background":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1042350/page_bg_generated_v6b.jpg?t=1663543376","screenshots":[{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1042350/ss_df3639c8d0489643a93a98728c24819b9aa441e1.600x338.jpg?t=1663543376","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1042350/ss_df3639c8d0489643a93a98728c24819b9aa441e1.jpg?t=1663543376"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1042350/ss_59fb9497c8574260750be6b22bfbdbfe773ad60f.600x338.jpg?t=1